│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ regime_crossover_xgb                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover version keeps the stronger parts of the later feature sets while reducing  │
│                          │ regime fragility and prediction collapse. It emphasizes shorter lookbacks, rolling        │
│                          │ z-score normalization, volatility/trend change features, and a few high-signal            │
│                          │ interactions such as momentum × volatility regime. The model is regularized more          │
│                          │ conservatively than the current baseline to improve out-of-sample slope without           │
