│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ regime_shortlook_xgb                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover version keeps the strongest robust ideas from the prior scripts while      │
│                          │ shifting feature emphasis toward shorter lookbacks, rolling normalization, and            │
│                          │ regime-change signals that are more likely to survive the train→test→val regime shift.    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key changes:                                                                              │
│                          │ - replaces many long-horizon, regime-specific features with shorter-window momentum,      │
│                          │ volatility, efficiency, and price-position features                                       │
│                          │ - adds rolling z-scored versions of core signals to make them more regime-invariant       │
│                          │ - adds explicit change-in-market-character features such as vol trend, autocorr trend,    │
│                          │ and efficiency trend                                                                      │
│                          │ - includes a compact momentum × volatility-regime interaction, which often generalizes    │
│                          │ better than either alone                                                                  │
│                          │ - simplifies and regularizes the XGBoost model slightly to reduce collapse while keeping  │
│                          │ enough expressivity                                                                       │
│                          │ - keeps the feature count safely below 80 and uses only past data                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The overall goal is to increase validation slope and correlation without overfitting the  │
│                          │ earlier regime.                                                                           │
