│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ regime_shift_xgb_crossover                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover version combines the strongest ideas from the prior variants while aiming  │
│                          │ to fix the main failure mode: the slope collapse on the validation regime.                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key changes:                                                                              │
│                          │ - Uses shorter lookbacks and more regime-invariant rolling z-scores.                      │
│                          │ - Adds explicit “change in market character” features such as volatility trend,           │
│                          │ efficiency trend, and rank-based regime descriptors.                                      │
│                          │ - Keeps the most useful interactions: momentum × volatility regime, momentum × fast       │
│                          │ volatility, volume × price-pressure, and funding × regime.                                │
│                          │ - Removes some long-horizon bias by avoiding very slow windows that likely overfit the    │
│                          │ training regime.                                                                          │
│                          │ - Slightly relaxes regularization compared to the current program so predictions are less │
│                          │ collapsed toward the mean.                                                                │
│                          │ - Clipping of feature outliers is preserved to improve stability across regime shifts.    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The feature count stays under the requested cap, and the implementation uses only past    │
│                          │ information.                                                                              │
