│                          │ regime-invariant                                                                          │
│                          │    - add explicit regime-shift features that measure divergence between short-, medium-,  │
│                          │ and longer-horizon normalized return behavior                                             │
│                          │    - add short-horizon volatility/efficiency trend features to capture changes in market  │
│                          │ character rather than just absolute levels                                                │
│                          │    - remove low-value time-of-day Fourier features to keep the feature count under the 80 │
│                          │ limit and reduce regime-specific leakage                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. Hyperparameters:                                                                       │
│                          │    - slightly increase model expressivity with a modestly deeper tree and lower child     │
│                          │ weight                                                                                    │
│                          │    - reduce regularization a bit so the model can use the new regime-shift features       │
│                          │    - keep estimator count and learning rate conservative enough to avoid exploding        │
│                          │ overfit                                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The goal is to lift validation slope and prediction spread while preserving the current   │
│                          │ directional edge.                                                                         │
